     ```
     (`provideAnimationsAsync()` was added then removed — see Errors section 3 — because `@angular/animations` is not an installed dependency and must not be added.)

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts`** (rewritten):
     ```ts
     export const appRoutes: Route[] = [
       { path: '', loadComponent: () => import('./features/movie-list/movie-list.component').then(m => m.MovieListComponent) },
       { path: 'screenings/:id/seats', loadComponent: () => import('./features/seat-map/seat-map.component').then(m => m.SeatMapComponent), resolve: { data: screeningResolver } },
       { path: 'screenings/:id/summary', loadComponent: () => import('./features/summary/summary.component').then(m => m.SummaryComponent), canActivate: [bookingInProgressGuard], resolve: { data: screeningResolver } },
       { path: 'screenings/:id/checkout', loadComponent: () => import('./features/checkout/checkout.component').then(m => m.CheckoutComponent), canActivate: [bookingInProgressGuard], resolve: { data: screeningResolver } },
       { path: 'confirmation', loadComponent: () => import('./features/confirmation/confirmation.component').then(m => m.ConfirmationComponent), canActivate: [paidBookingGuard] },
       { path: '**', redirectTo: '' },
     ];
     ```

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/movie-list/movie-list.vm.ts`** (created) — `MovieCardVm`, `ScreeningVm`, `buildMovieCards(movies, screenings)` groups screenings by movieId, filters to movies with ≥1 screening, sorts screenings by time string, preserves backend movie order.

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/movie-list/movie-list.component.ts`** (created) — Day picker computed from real `today()` (5 buttons: "Today" + 4 weekday names), `selectedDate`/`selectedIso` computed from query param via `toSignal(route.queryParamMap)`, loading state machine via `combineLatest([toObservable(selectedIso), retry$.pipe(startWith(undefined))]).pipe(switchMap(...))` emitting `{status:'loading'}` → `{status:'loaded', cards}` or `{status:'error'}`; `selectDate(iso)` navigates with `queryParams: {date: iso}`; `openScreening(id)` navigates to seats route.

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/movie-list/movie-list.component.html`** (created) — day-picker with day-button (`[attr.data-date]`, `[attr.data-selected]="isSelected(day.iso) ? 'true' : 'false'"` — fixed from a boolean binding bug, see Errors), date-picker input, `@if/@else-if` chain for movies-loading/movies-error/movies-empty/movie-list, movie-card with all required testids, screening-button loop.

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/movie-list/movie-list.component.scss`** (created) — basic flex/card layout.

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/seat-map/seat-map.vm.ts`** (created) — `buildSeatMapRows()` → 15 `{row, cells: buildRow(row)}` entries.

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/seat-map/seat-map.component.ts`** (created, edited to fix type cast) — Uses `injectResolvedScreening()`; `occupiedSet`/`selectedSet` as `computed(() => new Set(...))`; `seatState(row,column)` and `couchState(row,a,b)` derive `SeatState`; `selectedByRow` computed groups `toSeatUnits` output into display strings; constructor calls `this.bookingService.ensureBookingFor(id)` using `route.snapshot.paramMap.get('id')`; `onSeatClick`/`onCouchClick` guard against 'unavailable' before calling `bookingService.toggleSeat`/`toggleCouch`; `cancel()` clears booking + navigates to `/`; `continue()` no-ops if `selectedCount()===0`, else navigates to summary.

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/seat-map/seat-map.component.html`** (created) — title/subtitle/seat-limit-info/screen-indicator, `seat-map` grid of `seat-row`s each with `row-label-left`, `@for` over `r.cells` with `@switch (cell.kind)` producing `empty`/`aisle`/`seat`/`couch` elements (seat/couch are `<button>` with `[attr.data-row]`, `[attr.data-state]`, `[style.background-color]="colorFor(...)"`, click handlers), `row-label-right`, legend (`legend-item` per state with swatch), `selected-seats` panel (`selected-seats-count`, `selected-seats-row` per row), `cancel-button`/`continue-button` (continue disabled when `selectedCount()===0`).

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/seat-map/seat-map.component.scss`** (created) — CSS Grid: `.seat-row { grid-template-columns: 2rem repeat(4, minmax(1.6rem,1fr)) minmax(3.2rem,1fr) repeat(16, minmax(1.6rem,1fr)) minmax(3.2rem,1fr) repeat(4, minmax(1.6rem,1fr)) 2rem; }`, `.couch { grid-column: span 2; }`, `.cell` styling with inline background-color from TS (ensuring hover/focus can't override since no conflicting CSS rule exists).

   - **`apps/cinescope/src/app/features/summary/summary.component.ts`** (created, edited to fix type cast) — `injectResolvedScreening()`; `items` computed mapping `toSeatUnits(seats)` into `SummaryItemVm {unit, row, seatLabel, priceLabel}` (`seatLabel` is `Couch <a>-<b>` for couches); `totalLabel` computed as `formatPrice(sum of unit prices)`; `remove(unit)` calls `bookingService.removeUnit(unit)` then navigates to seats route if booking becomes empty; `back()`/`confirm()` navigate accordingly.

